    After the
    beep, repeat the five words in the same order.'
  encodingListenPromptText: Listen carefully.
  immediateRecallPromptText: Please repeat the five words now.
  readyForAreaBText: 'Well done.


    Press ENTER SHOWROOM to continue.'
  areaBGeneralInstructionText: '<b>Executive Task</b>


    You will be shown a set
    of characteristics.


    Select the ONE chair that matches

    ALL THREE characteristics.


    Use
    the controller trigger to select.


    Press READY when you understand the task.'
  chairTargetHeaderText: 'Find the chair that is:'
  showShapeLegendOnInstructions: 1
  chairSelectedFeedbackText: Selection recorded.
  executiveTaskCompleteText: Executive task complete
  areaCInstructionText: Once you hear the beep, repeat the five words that were presented
